// The root authserver module is wired via a local replace (it is never
// published). The official Go SDK is pulled from the module proxy at a
// tagged release — isolating it in the e2e module keeps the production
// authserver binary (cmd/authserver, root go.mod) from dragging it in.
replace github.com/authplane/authserver => ..
